<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>We received your message</title>
  <style>
    body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background: #f4f4f4; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; }
    .wrapper { width: 100%; background: #f4f4f4; }
    .header { width: 100%; background: #e5a503; text-align: center; color: #ffffff; padding: 40px 20px; font-size: 28px; font-weight: bold; }
    .main { width: 100%; background: #ffffff; }
    .content { max-width: 720px; margin: auto; padding: 40px 30px; }
    .subtext { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; color: #333333; }
    .highlight { color: #e5a503; font-weight: bold; }
    .box { background: #fafafa; border: 1px solid #eee; padding: 20px 25px; border-radius: 8px; margin-top: 20px; }
    .box p { margin: 0; font-size: 14px; color: #555; }
    .footer { width: 100%; background: #f7f7f7; text-align: center; padding: 30px 20px; font-size: 13px; color: #777; }
    .footer a { color: #e5a503; text-decoration: none; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="header">Message Received</div>
    <div class="main">
      <div class="content">
        <p class="subtext">Hello <strong>{{name}}</strong>,</p>
        <p class="subtext">
          Thank you for reaching out to the <span class="highlight">Asoose team</span>. We have received your message regarding
          <strong>"{{subject}}"</strong> and will get back to you as soon as possible.
        </p>

        <div class="box">
          <p>Our support team typically responds within <strong>24–48 hours</strong> on business days.</p>
        </div>

        <p class="subtext" style="margin-top: 24px;">
          If your issue is urgent, you can also reach us at
          <a href="mailto:hello@asoose.com" style="color: #e5a503;">hello@asoose.com</a> or call
          <a href="tel:+2348061966145" style="color: #e5a503;">+234 (0) 8061966145</a>.
        </p>

        <p class="subtext"><strong>The Asoose Team</strong></p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      &copy; {{year}} Asoose <br /><br />
      <a href="https://asoose.com">Visit Website</a> | <a href="https://asoose.com/contact">Contact Support</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
